      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important that you discuss this combination with your prescribing doctor or endocrinologist right away. Both hyperthyroidism and Adderall can increase heart rate and anxiety, which could cause your current symptoms to worsen. They need to carefully monitor how your body reacts to the thyroid medication alongside your ADHD treatment. Do not change your dosages or medications without consulting them first.",
